{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6724230173","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1201#issuecomment-6724230173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1201","id":6724230173,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkMucHQ","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?u=4a54630ef210e4f76a452eea65cda1b56370734c&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T16:47:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T16:47:32Z","author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Bounded follow-up from W09's conditional full-row review: three planned owners still describe their actual judgment-based grounding as `EXACT_MATCH`, which emits `semapv:LexicalMatching`. Independent triage confirms the method concern while retaining the established identities:\n\n- Borax `Na2b4o7_X_10_H2o.yaml`, payload `f3be9ddfe74195bdf64175b02a73db08f9d23317299930e4d1502e6ce48fa402`: CHEBI:38888 was selected after primary formula/structure accounting. Preserve the #318 chemistry, conventional decahydrate aliases, three UW dependencies and distinct DSMZ770 stock exception.\n- `Sulfur.yaml`, payload `eff9acd458d8e3a2c12fd743f523444001e30d64ce5710d9bc902fef8c716103`: the inherited #368 material-versus-atom correction explicitly records CURATOR_JUDGMENT. Preserve CHEBI:33403, rejected atom/polysulfur labels and historical authorship.\n- `Diarsenic_Trioxide.yaml`, payload `8d630caa382201110a476192206856c823447390b3576c17e3b008948fa7c36b`: the final proposal was enabled by resolving empirical As2O3 versus molecular As4O6 using the ChEBI 2:3 definition and PubChem. Preserve CHEBI:30621, oxide-versus-alkaline-stock scope and absent polymorph/lot assertions. Qualify the original reviewer wording: a real exact As2O3 OLS query exists (`5f9314de8d667b76299e52177e11017388a4febef14a5755f4cc46767bcc2b9d`) and returns one defining ChEBI target. Its synonym evidence must remain; related-synonym scope is not itself disproof. The manual recommendation reflects the recorded decisive representation adjudication, not a claim that no search occurred.\n\nMAPPING_SEMANTICS §0 and the native grade producer require truthful method provenance, separately from the own-identifier exact predicate. Recommend MANUAL_CURATION for these recorded judgments, with truthful LLM-assisted evidence/history and no human-verification claim. This is the mapping-quality method vocabulary, not the human-only MappingEvidence enum tracked by #1226. Do not invent a CAS/primary-label lookup, erase prior evidence, downgrade identity predicates or hand-patch generated rows. Independently review exact successor owners and complete native rows; retain all source, role and export holds.\n\nThe additional benzene-1,2,4-triol observation (`f2f3758b7b3793052a5b644bbfdbf78799ee7d412cc82982566b01f1ecef39d1`) remains provisional. The canonical name and source synonym are present in the official capture; ordinary substitution-pattern checking and LLM authorship do not alone prove a wrong lexical grade. Carry the exact-method trace qualification or obtain an accountable current resolution, without forcing an unsupported correction.\n\nExact scope is frozen plan `cdff9ef796b6c2ecf112218be61843fc1928f442ff4a7ddd89758ea116be8cb2`, baseline `84241993a278a7a413422ef89a52c0b47dc57831`, and W09 read-time FINDINGS `8b0f66bc89372b091d132abe542625db68444c3171e0cda22f9bb511e6ab8110`. W09 final packet completion was not inferred. The triage at `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/w09-method-findings-triage-v1` binds actual source decisions, primary bytes, authentic preimages and live issue context. C's prior Sulfur union authorship is disclosed; this is not a fresh whole-payload approval of C-authored composition. No corrective source, canonical, process-control or GitHub action occurred during triage.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6724230173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}